*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0011
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-08-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 830
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0011.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
    *> BASE INTEREST RATE
    05 STD-RATE           PIC 9V9999.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> RATE AFTER BONUS
    05 EFFECTIVE-RATE     PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM APPLY-BONUS
    PERFORM FIXED-TERM-BONUS
    DISPLAY "EFFECTIVE-RATE=" EFFECTIVE-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-BONUS.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS
    IF CUST-AGE >= 65 AND LEDGER-BAL >= 10000
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE = STD-RATE + 0.0025
    ELSE
        MOVE STD-RATE TO EFFECTIVE-RATE
    END-IF.
FIXED-TERM-BONUS.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'F'
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE = EFFECTIVE-RATE + 0.0015
    END-IF.
